# Mnemosyne /epistemology/scope schema — PAI-native context scopes
# Loaded by: Tools/SeedSchemas.ts (after classifiers)
# Standing constraint: no CRLF — Cayley silently fails on \r.
#
# Scope is the context within which an assertion holds. The same claim can be
# verified in one scope and fictional in another. Add your own scopes here as
# you partition your knowledge: per-project scopes, per-domain scopes, etc.

# ── PAI runtime scopes ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
